    {
      "id": "terminal-125-ga",
      "title": "Windows Terminal 1.25 正式推送，修正键盘与终端兼容",
      "titleId": "terminal-125-ga-title",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "Windows Terminal 1.25 修正意外加载美式键盘、Unicode 文件链接，以及主/备用屏幕切换时 Kitty Keyboard Protocol 状态丢失。",
          "variant": ""
        },
        {
          "text": "Windows 命令行代理与 TUI 用户可关注兼容改善；本条对应1.25.3131.0，不混入同日1.26 Preview的新开关。",
          "variant": "takeaway"
        }
      ],
      "sourceDate": "2026-11-11",
